  (text "POWER -- 12.6 V from P1 and 5 V from USB-C -- diode-OR, buck, LDO" (at 30 388 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "72c99868-3597-4b6e-8676-cbb2be0daf17"))
  (text "LOGIC -- machine interface, level stage, ESP32, both expanders" (at 30 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "f9d6d6f2-e86b-4e6b-9c2e-f155a8964c2c"))
  (text "PANEL -- the 11 lamps: 8 sourced by the panel expander, 3 sunk by it" (at 600 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "14cc0d7f-d203-4ce2-b0c7-cdffa0d7b798"))
  (text "AUDIO -- I2S class-D amp and the speaker" (at 600 348 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "420bef21-4385-4816-8449-aa48e598cce0"))
  (text "wifi-comm-pac Rev A - O1NEXT WiFi COMM PAC (issues #324, #325, part of #56)" (at 30 545 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "e0bea30e-5b2e-4aff-8f28-7597257fb511"))
  (text "J1 is a 2x5 IDC: pin n = DE-9 pin n for 1..9; pin 10 is spare." (at 30 551 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "176481a5-2933-4397-88f8-33a2a6696de8"))
  (text "Pin 7 is +12.6 V DC direct from the machine (2.02 A rail), NOT via R21." (at 30 557 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a982979b-6a25-4007-a767-73332149420a"))
  (text "U1/U2 translate the 5 V TTL side; U3 is the open-drain MSB sink." (at 30 563 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "76043eba-5ced-4efb-8807-538b7d59f8bb"))
  (text "U4 MAX3232 runs on 3V3 so its drivers swing +/-5.5 V into the bipolar RXD." (at 30 569 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "4a77f63c-5b5b-4ed8-ac3f-14b00da910f5"))
  (text "U6 = panel expander 0x58 (P0 push-pull CC, P1 open-drain). U7 = handshake 0x59." (at 30 575 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "bb46d098-c289-4066-8917-4bf2701a5cb8"))
  (text "Both expanders are fitted: neither is full, so the pin budget is closed." (at 30 581 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "d438a3f3-0a9f-4366-9546-c1c1782c412f"))
  (text "Power is diode-OR: 12.6 V -> 5 V path, and USB-C 5 V for bench work." (at 30 587 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "b085e504-50d7-44e5-863b-4e3e35d120fb"))
